  "notes": "Style V2: lean ash/obsidian hound with a deep loaded chest, straight planted forelegs, a ridge of obsidian plates over high withers, a pointed ear and tapered muzzle, one hot eye and restrained salmon seams. Front keys turn the head three-quarters to the hound's right: a low projecting muzzle, one small far ear, the head joined to a loaded shoulder with the rump behind it, and a dark jaw slot with no bright mouth block. Back views are 3/4 standing poses that keep the ears and plate ridge. Palette: palettes_v2.json Cinder obsidian/basalt/lava. Original 40x24 cells, (20,20) anchor, animation rows and durations retained. Vertical windup folds the hindquarters; leap extends the spine. ember_hound.rs maps the flight frames through Lunge and holds the landing on Skid. Native eight-way extension: projected articulated anatomy and native facet normals. Historical rows retained. Fixed totem lower plinth and gameplay projectile launch unchanged; furnace vanes turn around fixed firing pivot.",
